      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<section class=\"secret\">\n<p>The Mazebound is perfectly aware of the location of any creature inside the confines of the hedge maze it patrols. This allows it to automatically perceive creatures through hedge maze walls, and detect creatures that are hidden or invisible. This does not extend to creatures on the ethereal plane or flying above the walls of their maze, however.</p>\n</section>\n<p>The Mazebound have an unsettling ability to sense interlopers.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "revision": 1,
          "rules": "2024"
        },
